## Title: Cache ReQuest
## Notes: Filter your Quest Log, Objective Tracker and World Map by currencies, seasonal tokens, items and gold, stack nearby tracker quests, and keep a handwritten Field Tally of the quest items left to collect and tasks left to do, with your own tasks and a Ledger that notes your level-ups, achievements and quests turned in. /crq
